.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1685,0.5933,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Xilonen","r":[0.212,0.5933,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Keqing","r":[0.0815,0.6459,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Chevreuse","r":[0.125,0.6459,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.1685,0.6459,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.212,0.6459,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Keqing","r":[0.0815,0.7052,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.125,0.7052,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Yaoyao","r":[0.1685,0.7052,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.212,0.7052,0.0361,0.0289]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/keqing/261111-225016/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Mistsplitter Reforged","text":"High Base ATK, CRIT DMG and Elemental DMG bonuses make this her strongest general sword."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Cutter","text":"Massive CRIT Rate and a dependable ATK bonus. Watch her Burst passive to avoid excess CRIT Rate."},{"name":"Haran Geppaku Futsu","text":"CRIT Rate and Elemental DMG with a Normal Attack bonus that needs teammates to cast Skills."},{"name":"Uraku Misugiri","text":"CRIT DMG and buffs to Normal Attack and Skill damage; stronger when Geo damage triggers its bonus."},{"name":"Lion's Roar","text":"Boosts damage against enemies affected by Electro. High refinements make it a powerful 4-star option. Maintain Electro aura. Higher refinements help."},{"name":"The Black Sword","text":"Adds CRIT Rate and Normal Attack damage with a little healing, making her on-field combos more comfortable."},{"name":"Iron Sting","text":"Craftable EM sword that improves Aggravate damage and grants Elemental DMG bonuses after dealing damage. Best with Dendro reactions. Higher refinements help."},{"name":"Toukabou Shigure","text":"Event sword with Elemental Mastery and extra damage to a marked target. Useful in Aggravate if you own it. Limited event availability."}],"a":[{"names":["Thundering Fury"],"text":"Boosts Electro reactions and shortens Skill cooldown, giving Keqing extra Skill damage and flexible combos.","stats":"ATK% / Electro DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Grants Elemental Mastery and ATK from team composition, strengthening Aggravate damage.","stats":"ATK% or EM / Electro DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Thundersoother"],"text":"Boosts damage against Electro-affected enemies. Use only when your team keeps Electro applied reliably.","stats":"ATK% / Electro DMG / CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Lightning Commission","members":["Keqing","Fischl","Nahida","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Nahida maintains Quicken, Fischl adds powerful off-field Aggravate damage, and Kazuha buffs Electro while reducing enemy resistance. No dedicated healer.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Moonlit Voltage","members":["Keqing","Ineffa","Furina","Xilonen"],"text":"Ineffa enables Lunar-Charged and protects the team. Furina buffs damage while Xilonen heals and reduces resistance for Keqing.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Shielder","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Overload Authority","members":["Keqing","Chevreuse","Fischl","Xiangling"],"text":"Chevreuse reduces Electro and Pyro resistance after Overload. Fischl helps power Xiangling, whose Burst supplies Pyro. Xiangling needs high ER.","roles":["On-field DPS","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler"]},{"name":"Pika...chu?","members":["Keqing","Fischl","Yaoyao","Sucrose"],"text":"Yaoyao supplies Dendro and healing, Fischl adds Electro damage, and Sucrose shares EM while reducing Electro resistance.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Dendro Enabler","EM Buffer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Aggravate DPS: Use Thundering Fury, an Electro Goblet and Dendro support. Fischl is particularly valuable for team damage.\nGilded Alternative: Gilded Dreams is a good choice when its artifact substats beat your Thundering Fury pieces.\nOverload: Run only Pyro and Electro teammates with Chevreuse. Xiangling needs considerable Energy Recharge.\nCRIT Rate: Keqing gains 15% CRIT Rate after using her Burst, so avoid exceeding 100% after buffs.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Keqing is a fast Electro DPS who teleports into combat and chains infused attacks with her Burst. She shines in Aggravate teams, where frequent Electro hits trigger reactions and work especially well with Fischl. Her flexible rotations also support Overload and Lunar-Charged teams.","pros":["Fast Electro attacks","Flexible rotations","Strong Aggravate synergy","Low Energy needs"],"cons":["Charged Attacks use stamina","Can scatter light enemies","Weak early constellations","Needs good reaction support"],"weapons":["Mistsplitter Reforged","Primordial Jade Cutter","Haran Geppaku Futsu","Uraku Misugiri","Lion's Roar","The Black Sword","Iron Sting","Toukabou Shigure"],"arts":[{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Aggravate Best"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Aggravate Alternative"},{"sets":["Thundersoother"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Electro Aura Teams"}],"main":["ATK% / Elemental Mastery","Electro DMG Bonus","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["CRIT Rate: 60% - 75%","CRIT DMG: 140% - 200%","ATK: 1,700 - 2,200","Elemental Mastery: 100 - 250","Energy Recharge: 100% - 120%"],"vars":[{"title":"Aggravate Driver","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Mistsplitter Reforged","Lion's Roar","The Black Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance CRIT and EM; ATK remains helpful.","teams":"Dendro to sustain Quicken; Fischl is a strong partner.","when":"Frequent Electro hits drive Aggravate with reduced Skill cooldown.","cond":"Ensure stable Dendro application.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Electro-Charged","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Mistsplitter Reforged","The Black Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Thundering Fury"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Thundersoother"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize CRIT and ATK; adjust EM for reaction contribution.","teams":"Off-field Hydro and Electro support.","when":"A non-Dendro alternative using sustained Electro application.","cond":"Team performance depends on buffs and reaction ownership.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Lightning Prism","Teachings of Prosperity","Guide to Prosperity","Philosophies of Prosperity","Whopperflower Nectar","Shimmering Nectar","Energy Nectar","Cor Lapis","Ring of Boreas","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8 - 9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Lightning Commission","members":["Keqing","Fischl","Nahida","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Moonlit Voltage","members":["Keqing","Ineffa","Furina","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Overload Authority","members":["Keqing","Chevreuse","Fischl","Xiangling"]},{"name":"Pika...chu?","members":["Keqing","Fischl","Yaoyao","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Keqing","el":"Electro"}